typan-war-guide-title = Station War
typan-war-guide-body =
    T+0 — war declared, bluespace jumps blocked until hostilities begin. NT and Typan stations are placed on one map, 300 tiles apart.
    T+5:00 — hostilities begin; war armories unlock (TypanWarArmory tag).
    When combat begins, three 3×3 capture zones appear (NT station, Typan station, NT or Syndicate trade outpost). HQ announces labels A/B/C with locations.
    Hold a zone to earn capture points and receive faction supply crates (NT surplus / Syndicate surplus).
    60 min — combat timer; win by fewer losses or total elimination.
    Ally Protection — do not hit allies with ranged weapons.
